# Shell scripts must keep LF: a CRLF shebang (`#!/bin/sh`) is not executable,
# and core.autocrlf=true on a Windows checkout would rewrite this hook into one.
*.sh text eol=lf
# The price database (pricedb.py): binary SQLite files. Never text-convert, diff or
# three-way merge them; a conflict is resolved by taking ONE side's whole set.
*.db binary
